# Interview Companion - Production Environment Variables

## BACKEND (.env)
PORT=3000
NODE_ENV=production
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-service-role-key-here
ML_SERVICE_URL=http://localhost:8000

## ML SERVICE (.env in ml_service/)
GROQ_API_KEY=your-groq-api-key-here

## FRONTEND (.env.local in frontend/)
NEXT_PUBLIC_BACKEND_URL=https://your-backend-domain.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here

## Instructions
# 1. Copy this file to each service directory
# 2. Fill in the placeholders with actual values
# 3. DO NOT commit .env files to git
# 4. Add .env to .gitignore (already done)
# 5. Set these variables in your hosting platform's dashboard
